    "detailed_description": "We're excited to announce that our location-based entertainment (LBE) game has been adapted for online platforms and is now available on Steam. The game was originally designed to be an experience that could only be enjoyed in a specific location, but we've adapted it to be a unique online experience. We've made some minor changes to the game and are releasing it in Early Access, but we'd love to hear your feedback to make it even better. Thank you for your understanding and cooperation, and we look forward to creating new online experiences together!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br />\r\n* Simple, straightforward controls<br />\r\nCasual gun usage, simple rules, and linear progression make the game easy to pick up and play.<br />\r\nso even beginners who have never used VR can get up to speed quickly.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Fast-paced combat<br />\r\nFast-paced 1v1 battles on small but dense battlefields.<br />\r\nTest your skills in more tense and fast-paced battles",
    "about_the_game": "We're excited to announce that our location-based entertainment (LBE) game has been adapted for online platforms and is now available on Steam. The game was originally designed to be an experience that could only be enjoyed in a specific location, but we've adapted it to be a unique online experience. We've made some minor changes to the game and are releasing it in Early Access, but we'd love to hear your feedback to make it even better. Thank you for your understanding and cooperation, and we look forward to creating new online experiences together!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br />\r\n* Simple, straightforward controls<br />\r\nCasual gun usage, simple rules, and linear progression make the game easy to pick up and play.<br />\r\nso even beginners who have never used VR can get up to speed quickly.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Fast-paced combat<br />\r\nFast-paced 1v1 battles on small but dense battlefields.<br />\r\nTest your skills in more tense and fast-paced battles",
    "short_description": "Gunfighting is a first-person shooter game with a 1v1 simulated combat training concept that takes into account confined environments, such as inside a building, to confront the enemy.",
